(5070941, 739849, 96881, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo you have here  Even with the title, for me it struggles to meet the challenge, but ignoring that....<br/>The overexposed areas of skin on the first person are distracting.  The light needed to be less intense from the front, or, as this was Advaned Editing rules, this could have been selectively fixed during PP.  The lack of expression also does not appeal.</td>', 'Interesting photo you have here  Even with the title, for me it struggles to meet the challenge, but ignoring that....The overexposed areas of skin on the first person are distracting.  The light needed to be less intense from the front, or, as this was Advaned Editing rules, this could have been selectively fixed during PP.  The lack of expression also does not appeal.', '2008-11-19 02:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
