(5070959, 739332, 96881, '<td valign="top">A good landscape photo, really like the colours theough the sky and the reflections which you have through the still water.  The flatness of the land though means it is less appealing than it could have been, as there is little subject other than the sky in this photo.<br/> <br/>Also, the lack of anything really tied to the topic affects the score.</td>', 'A good landscape photo, really like the colours theough the sky and the reflections which you have through the still water.  The flatness of the land though means it is less appealing than it could have been, as there is little subject other than the sky in this photo. Also, the lack of anything really tied to the topic affects the score.', '2008-11-19 02:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
