(5070969, 739701, 96881, '<td valign="top">A very interesting picture of Yellow Seats.  What should have been a boring shot has turned out well due to the patterns thaat appear in the seats.  A great angle on the photo.  Exposure is good, and the person in the photo is able to be tied to the topic well.</td>', 'A very interesting picture of Yellow Seats.  What should have been a boring shot has turned out well due to the patterns thaat appear in the seats.  A great angle on the photo.  Exposure is good, and the person in the photo is able to be tied to the topic well.', '2008-11-19 02:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
