(5071816, 739761, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  Foreground part of the illusion works very well.  Not so sure about the bright shape in the background because I can''t quite figure out what it is or what it adds to the tale.</td>', 'Nicely done!  Foreground part of the illusion works very well.  Not so sure about the bright shape in the background because I can''t quite figure out what it is or what it adds to the tale.', '2008-11-19 07:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
