(5071829, 740203, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, dear.  Termites would be something of a nightmare for Art''s collection. I might play with some other angles and vary the DOF to see if I could come up with a more unusual presentation (not that I''ve seen a lot of ideas like this, just that the composition is pretty much straight on).</td>', 'Oh, dear.  Termites would be something of a nightmare for Art''s collection. I might play with some other angles and vary the DOF to see if I could come up with a more unusual presentation (not that I''ve seen a lot of ideas like this, just that the composition is pretty much straight on).', '2008-11-19 07:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071832, 740322, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lucky man to be lost out here!  Beautiful scene and composition is nice.  Colors are a little too washed out for a beach scene in the sun.</td>', 'Lucky man to be lost out here!  Beautiful scene and composition is nice.  Colors are a little too washed out for a beach scene in the sun.', '2008-11-19 07:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
