(5071895, 740180, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great title :-)  Like the angle and lighting.  My favorite so far (but I''m only 1/3 way through).</td>', 'Great title :-)  Like the angle and lighting.  My favorite so far (but I''m only 1/3 way through).', '2008-11-19 07:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
