(5071898, 740088, 100064, '<td valign="top">This is funny! My Art only had his face showing in a bunch of peas and would have said "Art is at Peas". I backed out and entered macro instead but this one is so similar to the one I was going to enter. Good one. ;)</td>', 'This is funny! My Art only had his face showing in a bunch of peas and would have said "Art is at Peas". I backed out and entered macro instead but this one is so similar to the one I was going to enter. Good one. ;)', '2008-11-19 07:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071903, 740250, 65234, '<td valign="top">LOL!  That certainly would discourage cheeriness, now wouldn''t it?  Nice job on the lighting.</td>', 'LOL!  That certainly would discourage cheeriness, now wouldn''t it?  Nice job on the lighting.', '2008-11-19 07:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071907, 740204, 65234, '<td valign="top">The lunatic is IN your head.  Er, his head.  Quite plausible, really ;-)  Rather nostalgic to see what appears to be the cover for a genuine Pink Floyd LP.</td>', 'The lunatic is IN your head.  Er, his head.  Quite plausible, really ;-)  Rather nostalgic to see what appears to be the cover for a genuine Pink Floyd LP.', '2008-11-19 08:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071911, 740267, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very pretty place to be.  Not sure I like the sun being so central and so much darkness from the cliff and its shadow so I might try some different crops.</td>', 'Very pretty place to be.  Not sure I like the sun being so central and so much darkness from the cliff and its shadow so I might try some different crops.', '2008-11-19 08:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071913, 740193, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, my.  Very sad.  I think this needs more DOF; the ash pile is only slightly soft and I think it would tell the story more strongly if it were clearer.</td>', 'Oh, my.  Very sad.  I think this needs more DOF; the ash pile is only slightly soft and I think it would tell the story more strongly if it were clearer.', '2008-11-19 08:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071916, 740229, 65234, '<td valign="top">In a dirigible!  You did get a very UFO-sighting look with this shot.  Which isn''t pretty and may not score well but you made me laugh so you get a bonus point for humor.</td>', 'In a dirigible!  You did get a very UFO-sighting look with this shot.  Which isn''t pretty and may not score well but you made me laugh so you get a bonus point for humor.', '2008-11-19 08:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071919, 739849, 65234, '<td valign="top">I''m amazed that I only see parts of one extra person (other than all the arms).  Looks like a tough shot to pull off.  If the one way in the back didn''t have sleeves showing this would work really well.</td>', 'I''m amazed that I only see parts of one extra person (other than all the arms).  Looks like a tough shot to pull off.  If the one way in the back didn''t have sleeves showing this would work really well.', '2008-11-19 08:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071924, 739425, 65234, '<td valign="top">Hey, I recognize that place from <i>Finding Nemo </i>;-)  I know, that''s pathetic.  That Woody looks to be in an extremely uncomfortable position for sighseeing.</td>', 'Hey, I recognize that place from Finding Nemo ;-)  I know, that''s pathetic.  That Woody looks to be in an extremely uncomfortable position for sighseeing.', '2008-11-19 08:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071927, 739190, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, my!  I feel so plebian :-(</td>', 'Oh, my!  I feel so plebian :-(', '2008-11-19 08:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071928, 740123, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  Looks like his plan for world domination is succeeding.</td>', 'Nicely done!  Looks like his plan for world domination is succeeding.', '2008-11-19 08:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071929, 740352, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, ow, ::groan::  Bad, bad pun.  Nice shot, though.</td>', 'Oh, ow, ::groan::  Bad, bad pun.  Nice shot, though.', '2008-11-19 08:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071932, 740247, 70689, '<td valign="top">Thought it was a shoehorn, until I looked better. Overall great picture, love the setting and lighting. 9</td>', 'Thought it was a shoehorn, until I looked better. Overall great picture, love the setting and lighting. 9', '2008-11-19 08:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071933, 739870, 65234, '<td valign="top">That looks like a city; he''s gotten more ambitious!</td>', 'That looks like a city; he''s gotten more ambitious!', '2008-11-19 08:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071936, 740021, 65234, '<td valign="top">Those are adorable sheep!!  And posing quite nicely, too.</td>', 'Those are adorable sheep!!  And posing quite nicely, too.', '2008-11-19 08:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071939, 740088, 65234, '<td valign="top">He also found the Fountain of Youth, it seems ;-)</td>', 'He also found the Fountain of Youth, it seems ;-)', '2008-11-19 08:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071941, 740025, 65234, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I never trusted that Thomas fellow; his smile is just creepy!</td>', 'Well done.  I never trusted that Thomas fellow; his smile is just creepy!', '2008-11-19 08:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071945, 740337, 70689, '<td valign="top">DNMC: the question where <i>is</i> Art, not where <i>was</i> Art.<br/> <br/>Just kidding :P I like the idea and the composition, seems a bit oversharpened though.</td>', 'DNMC: the question where is Art, not where was Art. Just kidding :P I like the idea and the composition, seems a bit oversharpened though.', '2008-11-19 08:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071947, 740358, 65234, '<td valign="top">He''s looking a little purple from the strain of his imprisonment.</td>', 'He''s looking a little purple from the strain of his imprisonment.', '2008-11-19 08:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071951, 739762, 65234, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sky.  I see Art has company on his travels; that''s nice.</td>', 'Gorgeous sky.  I see Art has company on his travels; that''s nice.', '2008-11-19 08:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071960, 740123, 70689, '<td valign="top">LOL, great job :D</td>', 'LOL, great job :D', '2008-11-19 08:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071970, 740062, 70689, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, I love that low horizon with the lone tree and the great sky. It may be a bit of a shoehorn, but the theme asks for shoehorns, so I don''t mind. 9</td>', 'This is a great shot, I love that low horizon with the lone tree and the great sky. It may be a bit of a shoehorn, but the theme asks for shoehorns, so I don''t mind. 9', '2008-11-19 08:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071971, 740294, 65234, '<td valign="top">WOW!  This is gorgeous!! The light coming in from the stained glass windows and the 3D feel to it ... wow.  Pillars seem a little distorted from the wide angle but the idea of the church closing in on him adds a nice hint of surreality to this.  I like it!</td>', 'WOW!  This is gorgeous!! The light coming in from the stained glass windows and the 3D feel to it ... wow.  Pillars seem a little distorted from the wide angle but the idea of the church closing in on him adds a nice hint of surreality to this.  I like it!', '2008-11-19 08:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071984, 739932, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute idea but but hard to evaluate as a photograph.</td>', 'Cute idea but but hard to evaluate as a photograph.', '2008-11-19 08:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071988, 739991, 65234, '<td valign="top">Another intriguing one that stimulates my imagination.</td>', 'Another intriguing one that stimulates my imagination.', '2008-11-19 08:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071997, 740268, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great pose!  Grass looks to be the focal area, though, and despite the title I want it to be the bird.</td>', 'Great pose!  Grass looks to be the focal area, though, and despite the title I want it to be the bird.', '2008-11-19 08:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5072004, 740183, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Wood Duck on a nicely mirrored lake.  Focus looks a bit sharper on the ripples than on the duck.</td>', 'Beautiful Wood Duck on a nicely mirrored lake.  Focus looks a bit sharper on the ripples than on the duck.', '2008-11-19 08:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5072013, 740299, 65234, '<td valign="top">Took me a sec to get this.  I think I need more coffee ;-)  Looks like you focussed on the crayon labels, which is fine, but I think a little more DOF so the tips could be in focus, too, would be better.</td>', 'Took me a sec to get this.  I think I need more coffee ;-)  Looks like you focussed on the crayon labels, which is fine, but I think a little more DOF so the tips could be in focus, too, would be better.', '2008-11-19 08:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5072018, 739165, 65234, '<td valign="top">Your illusion works fairly well; the lighting and the particular Art face you used combine to make his head seem 3 dimensional.</td>', 'Your illusion works fairly well; the lighting and the particular Art face you used combine to make his head seem 3 dimensional.', '2008-11-19 08:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5072025, 740174, 65234, '<td valign="top">No!  Not the camera, too!!!  Quite the crowded aquarium, there.  I think this idea might work better with a little less clutter, and/or a more homogenous background colorwise.</td>', 'No!  Not the camera, too!!!  Quite the crowded aquarium, there.  I think this idea might work better with a little less clutter, and/or a more homogenous background colorwise.', '2008-11-19 08:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5072028, 739730, 65234, '<td valign="top">Certainly an easy place to disappear if you want to do so.</td>', 'Certainly an easy place to disappear if you want to do so.', '2008-11-19 08:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5072030, 739230, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not quite working for me; too much reflected light in odd places on the background.</td>', 'Not quite working for me; too much reflected light in odd places on the background.', '2008-11-19 08:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5072034, 740218, 65234, '<td valign="top">I just voted on another large yellow vehicle.  Yours has a more interesting setting and sky.</td>', 'I just voted on another large yellow vehicle.  Yours has a more interesting setting and sky.', '2008-11-19 08:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5072038, 739069, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the richness of this.  I think I''d crop much tighter on top; I think the composition is dramatically stronger if the stream runs to the top of the frame and out.</td>', 'Like the richness of this.  I think I''d crop much tighter on top; I think the composition is dramatically stronger if the stream runs to the top of the frame and out.', '2008-11-19 08:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5072049, 739310, 65234, '<td valign="top">He''s a troll?!  I never would have suspected.  Looks like there was some water on the lens, maybe, to cause those bright round patches on the girders.  Since this was Advanced editing I''d clone them out.  I''d also play around with the timing some so the white blob had more definition.  Not always easy, I know.</td>', 'He''s a troll?!  I never would have suspected.  Looks like there was some water on the lens, maybe, to cause those bright round patches on the girders.  Since this was Advanced editing I''d clone them out.  I''d also play around with the timing some so the white blob had more definition.  Not always easy, I know.', '2008-11-19 08:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5072055, 740010, 65234, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I got this even before I read the title :-)  Maybe a tad overexposed but very funny.</td>', 'LOL!  I got this even before I read the title :-)  Maybe a tad overexposed but very funny.', '2008-11-19 08:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5072075, 740172, 65234, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  A flaming Woody!  Red is an appropriate background color.  I feel like the background needs a little more definition, though.  It''s disorienting to see the shadows below him and not be able to tell where the background shifts from horizontal to vertical.  If the background got a lot darker starting at a lower point in the image (somewhere directly behind him) and fading to black on top that would work better for me.  Maybe with a gradient filter or vignetting if you couldn''t light it that way.</td>', 'Yikes!  A flaming Woody!  Red is an appropriate background color.  I feel like the background needs a little more definition, though.  It''s disorienting to see the shadows below him and not be able to tell where the background shifts from horizontal to vertical.  If the background got a lot darker starting at a lower point in the image (somewhere directly behind him) and fading to black on top that would work better for me.  Maybe with a gradient filter or vignetting if you couldn''t light it that way.', '2008-11-19 09:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5072080, 740095, 65234, '<td valign="top">Bummer.  I can''t quite tell what the red objects are in the background or if they''re significant.  Nice focus on Godzilla''s teeth and claws, though.</td>', 'Bummer.  I can''t quite tell what the red objects are in the background or if they''re significant.  Nice focus on Godzilla''s teeth and claws, though.', '2008-11-19 09:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5072082, 740245, 65234, '<td valign="top">He got turned into a buck?  Looks like he''s been eating well and isn''t particularly unhappy with his lot in life.</td>', 'He got turned into a buck?  Looks like he''s been eating well and isn''t particularly unhappy with his lot in life.', '2008-11-19 09:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5072116, 739991, 99263, '<td valign="top">Cool shot...was this taken in South Africa by any chance?</td>', 'Cool shot...was this taken in South Africa by any chance?', '2008-11-19 09:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5072125, 739701, 99263, '<td valign="top">Great image</td>', 'Great image', '2008-11-19 09:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5072135, 739911, 39880, '<td valign="top">I''m interested in knowing where this is.  The B&amp;W looks great.  I''m cold just looking at it.</td>', 'I''m interested in knowing where this is.  The B&W looks great.  I''m cold just looking at it.', '2008-11-19 09:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
