(5076259, 740088, 59029, '<td valign="top">hope this little boy got a little extra in his allowance this week!  Great use of thirds, concept fun, model seems to be enjoying himself.  Just hope he''s not traumatized by having to portray such a dastardly fellow :-) 7</td>', 'hope this little boy got a little extra in his allowance this week!  Great use of thirds, concept fun, model seems to be enjoying himself.  Just hope he''s not traumatized by having to portray such a dastardly fellow :-) 7', '2008-11-20 16:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5076260, 740336, 59029, '<td valign="top">great lighting, simple concept, clean execution. 7</td>', 'great lighting, simple concept, clean execution. 7', '2008-11-20 16:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5076263, 739945, 59029, '<td valign="top">great use of a parking garage!  Cool lines, love the b/w and Art waiting with a camera on a tripod, ever so patiently. :-) 8</td>', 'great use of a parking garage!  Cool lines, love the b/w and Art waiting with a camera on a tripod, ever so patiently. :-) 8', '2008-11-20 16:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5076267, 739679, 59029, '<td valign="top">good concept, a little flat in terms of lighting and comp.  Assuming it''s OK to get closer to the building (ask permission if unsure), I''d get close to the office sign and try to shoot so the sign is more in perspective, and you can include some of the rest of the office space in the shot.</td>', 'good concept, a little flat in terms of lighting and comp.  Assuming it''s OK to get closer to the building (ask permission if unsure), I''d get close to the office sign and try to shoot so the sign is more in perspective, and you can include some of the rest of the office space in the shot.', '2008-11-20 16:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5076270, 739701, 59029, '<td valign="top">Very good concept and basically a good shot, but I think you cropped a little too tight above Art.  lovely colours.</td>', 'Very good concept and basically a good shot, but I think you cropped a little too tight above Art.  lovely colours.', '2008-11-20 16:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5076273, 739190, 59029, '<td valign="top">wow, so now I know what happened to my dinner service! jeez! :-) Like the tilt, very good shot with hardly any glare, not easy on so many reflecting shiny services.  Love the rubies in the plates. 7</td>', 'wow, so now I know what happened to my dinner service! jeez! :-) Like the tilt, very good shot with hardly any glare, not easy on so many reflecting shiny services.  Love the rubies in the plates. 7', '2008-11-20 16:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5076276, 740250, 59029, '<td valign="top">ahhh!  eeeek!  bwaaahahahahahaaa! great idea, well shot, and definitely a bit menacing.  Is he calling his line Satan Claus? :-) 8</td>', 'ahhh!  eeeek!  bwaaahahahahahaaa! great idea, well shot, and definitely a bit menacing.  Is he calling his line Satan Claus? :-) 8', '2008-11-20 16:54:48.000000', NULL, 1);
