(5078139, 740021, 59029, '<td valign="top">danged fencing!  You probably could''ve risked a tear or two in your clothing (or a jacket etc draped over barbed wire) and leant over the fence (carefully) to get a shot of sheep unobstructed.  Good idea though, nice enough shot.</td>', 'danged fencing!  You probably could''ve risked a tear or two in your clothing (or a jacket etc draped over barbed wire) and leant over the fence (carefully) to get a shot of sheep unobstructed.  Good idea though, nice enough shot.', '2008-11-21 20:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078142, 740228, 59029, '<td valign="top">good idea, but flat pov, blurry limbs/dishes and use of flash or other form of too-direct light kill this shot.</td>', 'good idea, but flat pov, blurry limbs/dishes and use of flash or other form of too-direct light kill this shot.', '2008-11-21 20:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078143, 740180, 59029, '<td valign="top">very good shot, love the pose/git and articulated woody, looks like he''s in a spotlight.  8</td>', 'very good shot, love the pose/git and articulated woody, looks like he''s in a spotlight.  8', '2008-11-21 20:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078148, 739429, 59029, '<td valign="top">wonderful serene atmospheric shot, could well be him there backpacking through this part of the world.  8</td>', 'wonderful serene atmospheric shot, could well be him there backpacking through this part of the world.  8', '2008-11-21 20:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078149, 740024, 59029, '<td valign="top">lol love the drama and creative aspect here, esp Zilla chasing after Art and Tyra Banks / Barbie! 8</td>', 'lol love the drama and creative aspect here, esp Zilla chasing after Art and Tyra Banks / Barbie! 8', '2008-11-21 20:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078151, 740130, 59029, '<td valign="top">LOL!  ooh my what a big lighter you have there, Art!  great smudgy effects on the village, the smug look on Art''s face is great.  bet he faved this! 9</td>', 'LOL!  ooh my what a big lighter you have there, Art!  great smudgy effects on the village, the smug look on Art''s face is great.  bet he faved this! 9', '2008-11-21 20:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078152, 739332, 59029, '<td valign="top">nice landscape but bland, I''d like to see a sense of story here.</td>', 'nice landscape but bland, I''d like to see a sense of story here.', '2008-11-21 20:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078155, 740221, 59029, '<td valign="top">pretty sunset, cool silhouettes, but would like to see Art here even just striding along between the trees to give it a sense of story.</td>', 'pretty sunset, cool silhouettes, but would like to see Art here even just striding along between the trees to give it a sense of story.', '2008-11-21 20:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078156, 739849, 59029, '<td valign="top">very neat idea and shot, I''d like to know how this was done.  Love the beer bottle and big set of arms right at the back, too funny! 9</td>', 'very neat idea and shot, I''d like to know how this was done.  Love the beer bottle and big set of arms right at the back, too funny! 9', '2008-11-21 20:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078157, 739497, 59029, '<td valign="top">love the hi-contrast, not so crazy about the comp...do you mean he''s in trunk of car? trolley? building?</td>', 'love the hi-contrast, not so crazy about the comp...do you mean he''s in trunk of car? trolley? building?', '2008-11-21 20:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078158, 739866, 59029, '<td valign="top">well umm errr hope all meth-lab ingredients been taken out of it first...nice forlorn look to the shotgun shack, love the tattiness of it. good comp too. 8</td>', 'well umm errr hope all meth-lab ingredients been taken out of it first...nice forlorn look to the shotgun shack, love the tattiness of it. good comp too. 8', '2008-11-21 20:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078161, 740283, 59029, '<td valign="top">lol too bad blue fairy turned him into a neutered woody!!! ;-) great colours and comp, nice startled expression in woody''s body language. lighting a little glarey but so what. 9</td>', 'lol too bad blue fairy turned him into a neutered woody!!! ;-) great colours and comp, nice startled expression in woody''s body language. lighting a little glarey but so what. 9', '2008-11-21 20:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078163, 739288, 59029, '<td valign="top">1-2-3 awwwwwwww... great thirds, love the silhouettes, cool lines leading to the couple by way of benches. 8</td>', '1-2-3 awwwwwwww... great thirds, love the silhouettes, cool lines leading to the couple by way of benches. 8', '2008-11-21 20:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078166, 740209, 59029, '<td valign="top">uh-ohhh...hope you know Zilla right behind you....:-) fun concept, good shot, love Z just coming into frame in a menacing manner. 7</td>', 'uh-ohhh...hope you know Zilla right behind you....:-) fun concept, good shot, love Z just coming into frame in a menacing manner. 7', '2008-11-21 20:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078168, 740172, 59029, '<td valign="top">Somehow I don''t see Art minding all that much!  This looks like a front-page shot to me based both on sentiment and clean simplicity of shot. 10</td>', 'Somehow I don''t see Art minding all that much!  This looks like a front-page shot to me based both on sentiment and clean simplicity of shot. 10', '2008-11-21 20:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078172, 740183, 59029, '<td valign="top">cute ducky but I''m worried he''s going to crash his bill on the border! 7</td>', 'cute ducky but I''m worried he''s going to crash his bill on the border! 7', '2008-11-21 20:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078177, 739848, 59029, '<td valign="top">lol funny and realistic, love that it''s actual grapes on a grapevine.  lighting a little boring but oh well. 8</td>', 'lol funny and realistic, love that it''s actual grapes on a grapevine.  lighting a little boring but oh well. 8', '2008-11-21 20:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078179, 739730, 59029, '<td valign="top">good shot but want more sense of the sheer size/busy-ness of NYC, like shot at very low pov with a furtive Art-like figure scurrying by.  This just looks a teeny bit safe.</td>', 'good shot but want more sense of the sheer size/busy-ness of NYC, like shot at very low pov with a furtive Art-like figure scurrying by.  This just looks a teeny bit safe.', '2008-11-21 20:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078182, 739816, 59029, '<td valign="top">so he''s in Flashdance? :-) like the pose and detail, nice comp and lighting.</td>', 'so he''s in Flashdance? :-) like the pose and detail, nice comp and lighting.', '2008-11-21 20:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078184, 740095, 59029, '<td valign="top">but would''t he be burning his way out by now? :-) would like to see Z''s belly in focus if that''s where he''s meant to be.  btw love the teeth.</td>', 'but would''t he be burning his way out by now? :-) would like to see Z''s belly in focus if that''s where he''s meant to be.  btw love the teeth.', '2008-11-21 20:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078188, 739471, 59029, '<td valign="top">lovely simple shot, great reflection, good use of b/w.  But I''d like to see some hint of Art...whether a figure at base of tower, or footprints in sand going to/from tower. 8</td>', 'lovely simple shot, great reflection, good use of b/w.  But I''d like to see some hint of Art...whether a figure at base of tower, or footprints in sand going to/from tower. 8', '2008-11-21 20:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078299, 740123, 59029, '<td valign="top">very funny, very clever and creative, fun shot, good comp and lighting, there''s a whole novel here!  10</td>', 'very funny, very clever and creative, fun shot, good comp and lighting, there''s a whole novel here!  10', '2008-11-21 21:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078302, 740322, 59029, '<td valign="top">nice beach shot but no real focal point, though some sense of Art having been there due to footrpints.</td>', 'nice beach shot but no real focal point, though some sense of Art having been there due to footrpints.', '2008-11-21 21:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078306, 739991, 59029, '<td valign="top">excellent shot, very gritty and realistic and sadly true to life.  Great capture. 10</td>', 'excellent shot, very gritty and realistic and sadly true to life.  Great capture. 10', '2008-11-21 21:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078315, 739552, 59029, '<td valign="top">good idea, would''ve been a better shot with cat looking up. also would eliminate the round border, crops out too much of the shot.</td>', 'good idea, would''ve been a better shot with cat looking up. also would eliminate the round border, crops out too much of the shot.', '2008-11-21 21:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078317, 740229, 59029, '<td valign="top">lol doesn''t it look just like every cheesy shot of a supposed UFO from the 70s? technically not a great shot but fun and imho does fit the challenge.</td>', 'lol doesn''t it look just like every cheesy shot of a supposed UFO from the 70s? technically not a great shot but fun and imho does fit the challenge.', '2008-11-21 21:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078318, 740280, 59029, '<td valign="top">Would be more convincing to draw figure in full, on ground first, in white chalk...THEN park car etc etc and maybe sling around some ketchup or cow''s blood or what have you.  Good idea and ok shot.</td>', 'Would be more convincing to draw figure in full, on ground first, in white chalk...THEN park car etc etc and maybe sling around some ketchup or cow''s blood or what have you.  Good idea and ok shot.', '2008-11-21 21:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078320, 740270, 59029, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, neat execution.</td>', 'Interesting idea, neat execution.', '2008-11-21 21:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078321, 740320, 59029, '<td valign="top">and he well could be lurking in the crowd.  Good idea, light a little strong through window, but the flag helps offset that. 7</td>', 'and he well could be lurking in the crowd.  Good idea, light a little strong through window, but the flag helps offset that. 7', '2008-11-21 21:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078322, 739661, 59029, '<td valign="top">Is that Twilight Zone theme music I hear? :-) could well be!  Light a little flat on foreground rock, I''d have tried to shoot from side to give greater sense of dof and make light more interesting.</td>', 'Is that Twilight Zone theme music I hear? :-) could well be!  Light a little flat on foreground rock, I''d have tried to shoot from side to give greater sense of dof and make light more interesting.', '2008-11-21 21:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078323, 740049, 59029, '<td valign="top">love that he''s after trolls!  Go get em! :-) Lots of detail, funny, fun to look at, great concept and execution. 8</td>', 'love that he''s after trolls!  Go get em! :-) Lots of detail, funny, fun to look at, great concept and execution. 8', '2008-11-21 21:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078324, 739870, 59029, '<td valign="top">good concept but a bit static...if the whole village were aflame and Art walking away or out of frame would be a lot stronger.</td>', 'good concept but a bit static...if the whole village were aflame and Art walking away or out of frame would be a lot stronger.', '2008-11-21 21:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078325, 740203, 59029, '<td valign="top">Alas poor YART, I knew him well...:-) very funny, could well be him! great textures. 7</td>', 'Alas poor YART, I knew him well...:-) very funny, could well be him! great textures. 7', '2008-11-21 21:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078326, 739136, 59029, '<td valign="top">nice shot of graffiti, great pov, but fail to see link to Art...</td>', 'nice shot of graffiti, great pov, but fail to see link to Art...', '2008-11-21 21:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078327, 740174, 59029, '<td valign="top">Bwaaahhahahaaaaahhhhaahaaa!!! LOVE this shot, very funny and well done, kudos on not getting glare off of aquarium! Great attention to detail, love the homemade props, all that''s missing are some real fish nibbling at Art but oh well, you got that whatsitsname character from Finding Nemo. 9</td>', 'Bwaaahhahahaaaaahhhhaahaaa!!! LOVE this shot, very funny and well done, kudos on not getting glare off of aquarium! Great attention to detail, love the homemade props, all that''s missing are some real fish nibbling at Art but oh well, you got that whatsitsname character from Finding Nemo. 9', '2008-11-21 21:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078329, 740072, 59029, '<td valign="top">love this shot cause it''s a cool setup, spooky/menacing character and what the hell is in the chalice? all at the same time.  Puts me in mind of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=25397" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Joey Lawrence</a>''s stuff.  very well done. 10</td>', 'love this shot cause it''s a cool setup, spooky/menacing character and what the hell is in the chalice? all at the same time.  Puts me in mind of  Joey Lawrence''s stuff.  very well done. 10', '2008-11-21 21:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078330, 739230, 59029, '<td valign="top">Very funny and timely picture, great use of scale and perspective, and all the judges in their trademark poses quite funny. 8</td>', 'Very funny and timely picture, great use of scale and perspective, and all the judges in their trademark poses quite funny. 8', '2008-11-21 21:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078331, 739955, 59029, '<td valign="top">Great almost otherworldly feel here, would love to know the pp on this.  WOnderful dof and perspective, lines are great. I think <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=63398" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">NikonJeb</a> has been taking pics of that train again!  if it is you, Jeb, yer busted boyo...if you''re NOT Jeb, you''ve just been paid a tremendous compliment.  9</td>', 'Great almost otherworldly feel here, would love to know the pp on this.  WOnderful dof and perspective, lines are great. I think  NikonJeb has been taking pics of that train again!  if it is you, Jeb, yer busted boyo...if you''re NOT Jeb, you''ve just been paid a tremendous compliment.  9', '2008-11-21 21:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078333, 740055, 59029, '<td valign="top">Basically a good shot but a lot more could''ve been done with it.  To me looks very safe and straightforward; it''s in focus, colours are pleasing, but dof and use of thirds need a little more work.</td>', 'Basically a good shot but a lot more could''ve been done with it.  To me looks very safe and straightforward; it''s in focus, colours are pleasing, but dof and use of thirds need a little more work.', '2008-11-21 21:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078335, 740010, 59029, '<td valign="top">lol funny cause I had a similar idea in mind, but this works very well!  Love the woodies poses and the rope/stakes made of twine and toothpicks.  Lighting very good, too easy to get glare in shots like this but you did very well 8</td>', 'lol funny cause I had a similar idea in mind, but this works very well!  Love the woodies poses and the rope/stakes made of twine and toothpicks.  Lighting very good, too easy to get glare in shots like this but you did very well 8', '2008-11-21 21:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078336, 740245, 51747, '<td valign="top">Awesome Mule Deer. Nice capture.</td>', 'Awesome Mule Deer. Nice capture.', '2008-11-21 21:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078337, 739476, 59029, '<td valign="top">Oh dear, one of those barmy Aussies is at it again :-) lots of fun, we defkinitely see a story here with Art possibly about to turn the world upside down (or vice versa?) love the bg, great dof. 8</td>', 'Oh dear, one of those barmy Aussies is at it again :-) lots of fun, we defkinitely see a story here with Art possibly about to turn the world upside down (or vice versa?) love the bg, great dof. 8', '2008-11-21 21:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078339, 739185, 59029, '<td valign="top">very unique shot, most others have lopped off their woodies'' lower extremeties! great sense of story and very effective minimalist use of Art. 8</td>', 'very unique shot, most others have lopped off their woodies'' lower extremeties! great sense of story and very effective minimalist use of Art. 8', '2008-11-21 21:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078340, 739910, 59029, '<td valign="top">lovely dreamy quality here, almost painterly.  Great light and the surf fisherman really adds to it. 8</td>', 'lovely dreamy quality here, almost painterly.  Great light and the surf fisherman really adds to it. 8', '2008-11-21 21:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078342, 739838, 59029, '<td valign="top">terrific story here, wonder what had just happened and what is about to happen. Very mysterious and moody. great b/w. 9</td>', 'terrific story here, wonder what had just happened and what is about to happen. Very mysterious and moody. great b/w. 9', '2008-11-21 21:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078343, 740193, 59029, '<td valign="top">Ooohh....love the copyright warning and logo, the pile of ash looks very real and yes I see the woody part in there too, Art walking away...all very realistic.  Only thing I might''ve done different is have Art carrying a burnt-out match with him, but might''ve got lost against bg. 8 anyway.</td>', 'Ooohh....love the copyright warning and logo, the pile of ash looks very real and yes I see the woody part in there too, Art walking away...all very realistic.  Only thing I might''ve done different is have Art carrying a burnt-out match with him, but might''ve got lost against bg. 8 anyway.', '2008-11-21 22:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078745, 740123, 65779, '<td valign="top">THis looks like something scalvert would do.</td>', 'THis looks like something scalvert would do.', '2008-11-22 04:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078772, 739476, 78236, '<td valign="top">The crop seems a little close on the head and I''d prefer to have more lighting on the globe. Good idea!</td>', 'The crop seems a little close on the head and I''d prefer to have more lighting on the globe. Good idea!', '2008-11-22 06:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5078773, 740285, 31664, '<td valign="top">Where'' the shot of it going booooom! :)</td>', 'Where'' the shot of it going booooom! :)', '2008-11-22 06:03:10.000000', NULL, 1);
