(5080094, 740267, 73564, '<td valign="top">Neat picture, looks like a painting we had on the wall when I was young (shape and all) assuming it was someone famous because they were quite common, but I couldn''t tell you who. I love the colors in this and the comp is really strong, I like how the person is far away, and title goes really well. The reflection is great how it creeps around the rock, instead of being stopped by it. Great work. Hope to see this on the fp. (not voting, sorry)</td>', 'Neat picture, looks like a painting we had on the wall when I was young (shape and all) assuming it was someone famous because they were quite common, but I couldn''t tell you who. I love the colors in this and the comp is really strong, I like how the person is far away, and title goes really well. The reflection is great how it creeps around the rock, instead of being stopped by it. Great work. Hope to see this on the fp. (not voting, sorry)', '2008-11-23 14:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
