(5080578, 740229, 96881, '<td valign="top">The noise in this photo is a major detraction from it.  The idea was good, but the overall effect and what else can be chieved with the photo is limited.  I am guessing this is a crop of a small area of another photo.</td>', 'The noise in this photo is a major detraction from it.  The idea was good, but the overall effect and what else can be chieved with the photo is limited.  I am guessing this is a crop of a small area of another photo.', '2008-11-23 21:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080580, 740352, 96881, '<td valign="top">A completely different take that meets the challenge well.  The colours of the Neaon make this interesting.  The added clutter of surrounding things is something you could do little about.  Cropping out the partly obstructed Scene at the bottom of the frame may have helped though.....</td>', 'A completely different take that meets the challenge well.  The colours of the Neaon make this interesting.  The added clutter of surrounding things is something you could do little about.  Cropping out the partly obstructed Scene at the bottom of the frame may have helped though.....', '2008-11-23 21:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080588, 740322, 96881, '<td valign="top">The location is nice, however I feel I want to see what is to the right.  I feel that more water and land to the right may have added to the photo.  It may not have been as DPC friendly though, but I am a fan of panoramic photos.  The colours are alright without really being brilliant.  SOme extra PP work may improve the impact of this photo.</td>', 'The location is nice, however I feel I want to see what is to the right.  I feel that more water and land to the right may have added to the photo.  It may not have been as DPC friendly though, but I am a fan of panoramic photos.  The colours are alright without really being brilliant.  SOme extra PP work may improve the impact of this photo.', '2008-11-23 21:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080594, 740072, 96881, '<td valign="top">I think some fill in light was needed for this.  The overall darkness, with the Man blending into the background in places (Hair, left shoulder and arm) mean the effect is lost.</td>', 'I think some fill in light was needed for this.  The overall darkness, with the Man blending into the background in places (Hair, left shoulder and arm) mean the effect is lost.', '2008-11-23 21:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080597, 740267, 96881, '<td valign="top">nice.  A landscape that though is connected to the challenge, and has some thought put into it.  The lone person on the cliff makes this photo from the challenge side.<br/>The colours through the sky are great, well done</td>', 'nice.  A landscape that though is connected to the challenge, and has some thought put into it.  The lone person on the cliff makes this photo from the challenge side.The colours through the sky are great, well done', '2008-11-23 21:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080601, 740252, 96881, '<td valign="top">Struggling to see the connection to the challenge here in this photo......<br/>Ignoring that, it is a very interesting capture.   The sky works well against the Sillouette here, which is a very interesting shape.  I think though, if the sun was not in the photo as a bright spot in the corner (ie taken slightly earlier), then the overall image would be improved further.</td>', 'Struggling to see the connection to the challenge here in this photo......Ignoring that, it is a very interesting capture.   The sky works well against the Sillouette here, which is a very interesting shape.  I think though, if the sun was not in the photo as a bright spot in the corner (ie taken slightly earlier), then the overall image would be improved further.', '2008-11-23 21:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080604, 740203, 96881, '<td valign="top">We hope not.<br/>Great, and different idea, helps it stand out from the crowd.<br/>I would have gone for a greater depth of field, so that the shavings at the top of the pile were in focus, as they at the moment are a little distracting the way they are.</td>', 'We hope not.Great, and different idea, helps it stand out from the crowd.I would have gone for a greater depth of field, so that the shavings at the top of the pile were in focus, as they at the moment are a little distracting the way they are.', '2008-11-23 21:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080606, 739932, 96881, '<td valign="top">Tell zilla to give him back......<br/>Different idea and achieved the intent well.  Normally not a fan of this type of Photography effect, however you have pulled it off well, and it fits the challenge perfectly........well done</td>', 'Tell zilla to give him back......Different idea and achieved the intent well.  Normally not a fan of this type of Photography effect, however you have pulled it off well, and it fits the challenge perfectly........well done', '2008-11-23 21:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080774, 740259, 29906, '<td valign="top">I love it.</td>', 'I love it.', '2008-11-23 23:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080775, 740358, 29906, '<td valign="top">Haha, great idea.</td>', 'Haha, great idea.', '2008-11-23 23:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080799, 740062, 96881, '<td valign="top">Interesing composition........Not really sure what to think about this.  It goes against all rules of thumb etc to to with Photography, yet somehow it, to some extent, works.<br/>I have been rather critical of people who shoehorned in landscapes, yet this photo, and its composition, makes me think it was taken with the challenge in mind.......<br/>This light is good, the colours are spot on.  There is still a lot of sky in the photo, and little else. Would have been great if the back of the sky was not completely clouded, but you can''t fix nature.<br/>Still can''t make up my mind on this, I can''t see it being as effective with more foreground.  I am sure you are going to get people bagging you for the lack of it though.  I''ve talked myself into it, well done, you have made me think, and the composition is very effective.</td>', 'Interesing composition........Not really sure what to think about this.  It goes against all rules of thumb etc to to with Photography, yet somehow it, to some extent, works.I have been rather critical of people who shoehorned in landscapes, yet this photo, and its composition, makes me think it was taken with the challenge in mind.......This light is good, the colours are spot on.  There is still a lot of sky in the photo, and little else. Would have been great if the back of the sky was not completely clouded, but you can''t fix nature.Still can''t make up my mind on this, I can''t see it being as effective with more foreground.  I am sure you are going to get people bagging you for the lack of it though.  I''ve talked myself into it, well done, you have made me think, and the composition is very effective.', '2008-11-23 23:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080801, 740310, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I like the composition, but I am not a fan of the Post Processing you have used.  The effcet is just not something I like much, but at least it is not too overdone like some other people tend to do.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I like the composition, but I am not a fan of the Post Processing you have used.  The effcet is just not something I like much, but at least it is not too overdone like some other people tend to do.', '2008-11-23 23:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080802, 739762, 96881, '<td valign="top">Good idea here.  Nice Sillouette you have with the woody on Art''s Shoulder.  The Sun''s Rays are great.</td>', 'Good idea here.  Nice Sillouette you have with the woody on Art''s Shoulder.  The Sun''s Rays are great.', '2008-11-23 23:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080812, 739476, 96881, '<td valign="top">Art is welcome to visit us down here whenever he wants.  Love the background you have in this.  A little more fil light from the front would help as the globe and woody''s hand are a little dark on my screen.<br/>The lighting effect though on woody''s head works well</td>', 'Art is welcome to visit us down here whenever he wants.  Love the background you have in this.  A little more fil light from the front would help as the globe and woody''s hand are a little dark on my screen.The lighting effect though on woody''s head works well', '2008-11-23 23:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080817, 739069, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  I like the effect you are trying to get with the stream.  However, the trees are a little restricting i the photo, especially with the area visible to the right of the right tree.  Also, there is little impact from the photo, and there is no strong connection to the challenge topic</td>', 'Nice picture.  I like the effect you are trying to get with the stream.  However, the trees are a little restricting i the photo, especially with the area visible to the right of the right tree.  Also, there is little impact from the photo, and there is no strong connection to the challenge topic', '2008-11-24 00:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080820, 739945, 57277, '<td valign="top">This one is my favorite. The location is intriguing and you captured it beautifully. Nice title.</td>', 'This one is my favorite. The location is intriguing and you captured it beautifully. Nice title.', '2008-11-24 00:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080935, 740166, 85430, '<td valign="top">very beautiful</td>', 'very beautiful', '2008-11-24 01:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081040, 740088, 89723, '<td valign="top">TOO Funny,</td>', 'TOO Funny,', '2008-11-24 02:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081206, 739310, 76598, '<td valign="top">Nice image, is that a light or lens flare?</td>', 'Nice image, is that a light or lens flare?', '2008-11-24 08:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081898, 739770, 68947, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors and contrast.  I''m sure it was difficult to capture the glass balls and likely, he was moving his hands while shooting it but, really nicely done.</td>', 'beautiful colors and contrast.  I''m sure it was difficult to capture the glass balls and likely, he was moving his hands while shooting it but, really nicely done.', '2008-11-24 15:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081899, 740166, 68947, '<td valign="top">Really cute Woody in honor of Art. ;)  Really clever</td>', 'Really cute Woody in honor of Art. ;)  Really clever', '2008-11-24 15:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081900, 739866, 68947, '<td valign="top">LOL......great title and oddball idea that really fits Art''s seeming personality!  Really cute!</td>', 'LOL......great title and oddball idea that really fits Art''s seeming personality!  Really cute!', '2008-11-24 15:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081901, 739429, 68947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenery and really well shot.  The colors are tremendous!</td>', 'Beautiful scenery and really well shot.  The colors are tremendous!', '2008-11-24 15:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081905, 740171, 68947, '<td valign="top">Great color and clarity, great editing.  Wait, let me ask if you''re getting any feedback on the grass in the lower right hand corner being "distracting"? LOL  I''ve had that kind of comment before when I''ve had similar instances.  I really like this shot though.</td>', 'Great color and clarity, great editing.  Wait, let me ask if you''re getting any feedback on the grass in the lower right hand corner being "distracting"? LOL  I''ve had that kind of comment before when I''ve had similar instances.  I really like this shot though.', '2008-11-24 15:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081907, 739762, 68947, '<td valign="top">Really goregous shot!  The light coming through the clouds, the color...the silhouette....really gorgeous shot!</td>', 'Really goregous shot!  The light coming through the clouds, the color...the silhouette....really gorgeous shot!', '2008-11-24 15:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081909, 740322, 68947, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of "Footprints In The Sand"!  Beautiful scenery!  Wish I were there!  I''d have liked to have seen a bit more contrast/bump up of saturation on this shot but, it''s really well done!</td>', 'Reminds me of "Footprints In The Sand"!  Beautiful scenery!  Wish I were there!  I''d have liked to have seen a bit more contrast/bump up of saturation on this shot but, it''s really well done!', '2008-11-24 15:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081910, 739761, 68947, '<td valign="top">LOL.....really nicely done!  Love the background as a "frame" to the ball!</td>', 'LOL.....really nicely done!  Love the background as a "frame" to the ball!', '2008-11-24 15:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081912, 739868, 68947, '<td valign="top">LOL.....where''s his Mountie Uniform? ;-)  As a fellow Canuck...love the shot!</td>', 'LOL.....where''s his Mountie Uniform? ;-)  As a fellow Canuck...love the shot!', '2008-11-24 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081913, 740293, 68947, '<td valign="top">Great editing on this one.</td>', 'Great editing on this one.', '2008-11-24 16:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081914, 740229, 68947, '<td valign="top">LOL.......cute idea!  Have you looked into any noise removal software, like Noiseware Community edition?  It''s free and it would have taken away some of this grain...but, I love the idea.  Made me really chuckle!</td>', 'LOL.......cute idea!  Have you looked into any noise removal software, like Noiseware Community edition?  It''s free and it would have taken away some of this grain...but, I love the idea.  Made me really chuckle!', '2008-11-24 16:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081942, 739425, 96881, '<td valign="top">So, Art''s Visiting Australia.  The shot is very cluttered.  I am trying to remember this exact spot, cause the photo would have been better IMO if it was taken from further to the left with a more standard crop, such that the ferry and the bridge were not competing for the same space (just can''t remember how much room is there though)  The positioning of the woody is a little awkward, I didn''t know that Art could bend his body like that.  Having him sit on the ledge, and being more in focus, would have been better.<br/>Shame about the weather, Sydney obviously was not producing those Blue sky days, as the grey/White sky means there is little impact in the photo.</td>', 'So, Art''s Visiting Australia.  The shot is very cluttered.  I am trying to remember this exact spot, cause the photo would have been better IMO if it was taken from further to the left with a more standard crop, such that the ferry and the bridge were not competing for the same space (just can''t remember how much room is there though)  The positioning of the woody is a little awkward, I didn''t know that Art could bend his body like that.  Having him sit on the ledge, and being more in focus, would have been better.Shame about the weather, Sydney obviously was not producing those Blue sky days, as the grey/White sky means there is little impact in the photo.', '2008-11-24 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081952, 740055, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice Photo of the Eye.  I like the composition in this.</td>', 'Nice Photo of the Eye.  I like the composition in this.', '2008-11-24 16:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081999, 740221, 96881, '<td valign="top">Some interesting colours you have in the sky int his shot.  Personally, the blue I think is a little overdone and unatural looking.  The reds etc though are brilliant.  I think there is too much blue sky int eh photo, and thus I would have cropped part of it out.  This also then removes the dark areas at the edge of the photo in the sky, further enhancing the shot.  To balance the photo more, some extra space at the botttom (yes, black area) also would have helped, as the current crop is a little too close to the sky.<br/> <br/>Its a nice photo, yet even with the title, its a stretch to meet the topic though.</td>', 'Some interesting colours you have in the sky int his shot.  Personally, the blue I think is a little overdone and unatural looking.  The reds etc though are brilliant.  I think there is too much blue sky int eh photo, and thus I would have cropped part of it out.  This also then removes the dark areas at the edge of the photo in the sky, further enhancing the shot.  To balance the photo more, some extra space at the botttom (yes, black area) also would have helped, as the current crop is a little too close to the sky. Its a nice photo, yet even with the title, its a stretch to meet the topic though.', '2008-11-24 16:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082003, 739429, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice effect you have there.  Having the person in the photo means it meets the challenge correctly.  Without the person, it would have been another landscape shoehorned in.<br/>i like the colours in the sky, and the effect you have with the clouds.  The person is perhaps a little dark (could have lightened him under the Advanced rules).  The reflections in the water are great.   Well Done</td>', 'Nice effect you have there.  Having the person in the photo means it meets the challenge correctly.  Without the person, it would have been another landscape shoehorned in.i like the colours in the sky, and the effect you have with the clouds.  The person is perhaps a little dark (could have lightened him under the Advanced rules).  The reflections in the water are great.   Well Done', '2008-11-24 16:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082013, 740172, 96881, '<td valign="top">I liek the idea of a burning Woody.  The Red background I don''t think works.  It means that much of the Fire effect is lost.  This against a black backdrop I think would have been strunning.  Also, A faster shutter speed would also have enhanced the photo then.</td>', 'I liek the idea of a burning Woody.  The Red background I don''t think works.  It means that much of the Fire effect is lost.  This against a black backdrop I think would have been strunning.  Also, A faster shutter speed would also have enhanced the photo then.', '2008-11-24 16:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082126, 740130, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the idea on this, a Woodied Art is a great touch to the photo.  The background looks like a print of a burning scene, and you have managed to make Art not look too out of place in it.  Often in these, the thing in front stands out due to lighting etc but you have acheived it reasonably well.<br/>Having said that, the colours overall, and the effect of photographing a printed scene give it a flat look (but then again, you couldn''t really go and torch a village...)</td>', 'I like the idea on this, a Woodied Art is a great touch to the photo.  The background looks like a print of a burning scene, and you have managed to make Art not look too out of place in it.  Often in these, the thing in front stands out due to lighting etc but you have acheived it reasonably well.Having said that, the colours overall, and the effect of photographing a printed scene give it a flat look (but then again, you couldn''t really go and torch a village...)', '2008-11-24 17:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082136, 740228, 96881, '<td valign="top">The noise in the photo is a problem, and detracts from what you were trying to achieve.  There is very harsh lighting, causing bright areas and harsh shaddows in the photo.  On top of this, the colours are uninspiring.  For this to work, it needed bright colours in the shot.</td>', 'The noise in the photo is a problem, and detracts from what you were trying to achieve.  There is very harsh lighting, causing bright areas and harsh shaddows in the photo.  On top of this, the colours are uninspiring.  For this to work, it needed bright colours in the shot.', '2008-11-24 17:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082139, 740130, 100837, '<td valign="top">I love this one. great background</td>', 'I love this one. great background', '2008-11-24 17:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082142, 739288, 100837, '<td valign="top">I really like the outline of the two people.</td>', 'I really like the outline of the two people.', '2008-11-24 17:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082143, 740270, 100837, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2008-11-24 17:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082147, 739761, 100837, '<td valign="top">that cool. really like it.</td>', 'that cool. really like it.', '2008-11-24 17:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082150, 740252, 100837, '<td valign="top">like the color of the background.</td>', 'like the color of the background.', '2008-11-24 17:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082153, 739870, 100837, '<td valign="top">Like the flame</td>', 'Like the flame', '2008-11-24 17:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082154, 740337, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The shallow depth of field was what was required.  Wondering what shutter speed you used though, as the car looks like there is some motion blur (might just be my eyes playing tricks)  This photo still needs a fast shutter speed to stop the car, so that the blur is DOF, rather than motion.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The shallow depth of field was what was required.  Wondering what shutter speed you used though, as the car looks like there is some motion blur (might just be my eyes playing tricks)  This photo still needs a fast shutter speed to stop the car, so that the blur is DOF, rather than motion.', '2008-11-24 17:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082157, 740193, 100837, '<td valign="top">hahaha funny.</td>', 'hahaha funny.', '2008-11-24 17:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082163, 739932, 100837, '<td valign="top">funny</td>', 'funny', '2008-11-24 17:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082166, 740123, 100837, '<td valign="top">cool Editing</td>', 'cool Editing', '2008-11-24 17:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082180, 738801, 100837, '<td valign="top">Take out the text. but other then that pritty good</td>', 'Take out the text. but other then that pritty good', '2008-11-24 17:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082183, 740267, 100837, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2008-11-24 17:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082188, 739230, 100837, '<td valign="top">funny!!</td>', 'funny!!', '2008-11-24 17:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082191, 740322, 100837, '<td valign="top">love that photo!</td>', 'love that photo!', '2008-11-24 17:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082195, 740172, 100837, '<td valign="top">cool effect.</td>', 'cool effect.', '2008-11-24 17:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082218, 739471, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  The black and white works really well here.  I like the detail int he sand, the refelctions in the water.<br/>Well Done</td>', 'Great photo.  The black and white works really well here.  I like the detail int he sand, the refelctions in the water.Well Done', '2008-11-24 18:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082223, 740204, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  The colours running through the shot give this something extra.  The slightly overexposed areas I think add to the photo, rather then being a problem here.  Good Submission</td>', 'Great idea.  The colours running through the shot give this something extra.  The slightly overexposed areas I think add to the photo, rather then being a problem here.  Good Submission', '2008-11-24 18:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082234, 739945, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice Idea.  An interesting place to shoot a photo, and meets the challenge well.  The photographer does though blend a little too much into the background, and therefore is not as noticable as he should be.</td>', 'Nice Idea.  An interesting place to shoot a photo, and meets the challenge well.  The photographer does though blend a little too much into the background, and therefore is not as noticable as he should be.', '2008-11-24 18:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082288, 739230, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The colours in the background are washed out, however it would have been hard to achieve this and also get the colours shot on, while having the woody still well lit.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The colours in the background are washed out, however it would have been hard to achieve this and also get the colours shot on, while having the woody still well lit.', '2008-11-24 18:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082309, 739190, 96881, '<td valign="top">Love the picture.  I like the angle it is shot at, the DOF is spot on.  The lighting highlights on the clagg and cutlery works well.  Great Submission</td>', 'Love the picture.  I like the angle it is shot at, the DOF is spot on.  The lighting highlights on the clagg and cutlery works well.  Great Submission', '2008-11-24 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082311, 739868, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, woody is sharp and well lit.  The DOF is right.  Would have been great if the background was not rocks, as it gives the overall picture too much of a brown look.  A sky background would have then made it look like he was high up, and given that extra colour to the shot.</td>', 'Nice photo, woody is sharp and well lit.  The DOF is right.  Would have been great if the background was not rocks, as it gives the overall picture too much of a brown look.  A sky background would have then made it look like he was high up, and given that extra colour to the shot.', '2008-11-24 18:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082357, 740133, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Some stuff in the sky at the top is showing on my monitor (patchy blue shades???).<br/>Struggling though to fit this to the topic......<br/>Adding some extra comment<br/>Back for another look and have noticed something else (its a bugger when you miss something).  I did not see the caravan in this photo on my first look through.  That then does change the last comment I made, as now it does meet the topic quite well (there are other photos of just landscapes that are shoehorned in).  The isolated caravan is a great touch, and makes this photo.  Wish i was in that Van at the moment.......<br/>Still see weird stuff in the sky at the top.  The greens could have done with a boost.  A greater depth of field to keep the really sharp focus all through also could have helped, but bumping you up anyway.........</td>', 'Nice photo.  Some stuff in the sky at the top is showing on my monitor (patchy blue shades???).Struggling though to fit this to the topic......Adding some extra commentBack for another look and have noticed something else (its a bugger when you miss something).  I did not see the caravan in this photo on my first look through.  That then does change the last comment I made, as now it does meet the topic quite well (there are other photos of just landscapes that are shoehorned in).  The isolated caravan is a great touch, and makes this photo.  Wish i was in that Van at the moment.......Still see weird stuff in the sky at the top.  The greens could have done with a boost.  A greater depth of field to keep the really sharp focus all through also could have helped, but bumping you up anyway.........', '2008-11-24 18:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082429, 740010, 96881, '<td valign="top">Different idea.  I think the direct light is a little strong, as it overexposed areas ont he woodies and the arm, but lighting this was always going to be a bit difficult.</td>', 'Different idea.  I think the direct light is a little strong, as it overexposed areas ont he woodies and the arm, but lighting this was always going to be a bit difficult.', '2008-11-24 19:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082433, 739848, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like the natural backlighting highlight from the sun behind the clouds.  The overall lightinf is good, woody is sharp, DOF is well controlled.  Good submission</td>', 'Nice, I like the natural backlighting highlight from the sun behind the clouds.  The overall lightinf is good, woody is sharp, DOF is well controlled.  Good submission', '2008-11-24 19:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082448, 739870, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute! Another colour background might have made the flames stand out more.</td>', 'Cute! Another colour background might have made the flames stand out more.', '2008-11-24 19:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082450, 739816, 43774, '<td valign="top">LOL, you found him dancing?</td>', 'LOL, you found him dancing?', '2008-11-24 19:49:00.000000', NULL, 1);
