(5083954, 740166, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great Photo.  One of the best in the challenge.  Love the light, the reflections are good.  Great Submission</td>', 'Great Photo.  One of the best in the challenge.  Love the light, the reflections are good.  Great Submission', '2008-11-25 18:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5084054, 740294, 96881, '<td valign="top">A well executed photo in what is often very tricky lighting conditions.  You have managed to get good colours, and avoided the lareg Underexposed and overexposed areas which often happens in Church photography.</td>', 'A well executed photo in what is often very tricky lighting conditions.  You have managed to get good colours, and avoided the lareg Underexposed and overexposed areas which often happens in Church photography.', '2008-11-25 19:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5084055, 740025, 96881, '<td valign="top">Poor Art.......It will make a mess.......<br/>Not 100% sold on the Border on this though....</td>', 'Poor Art.......It will make a mess.......Not 100% sold on the Border on this though....', '2008-11-25 19:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5084058, 740320, 96881, '<td valign="top">Very tricky lighting here, woth the main light coming from directly in front.  The picture is overall a bit dark, however it would have been very difficult to expose it much more while avoiding totally blowing out the centre window area.</td>', 'Very tricky lighting here, woth the main light coming from directly in front.  The picture is overall a bit dark, however it would have been very difficult to expose it much more while avoiding totally blowing out the centre window area.', '2008-11-25 19:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5084060, 740088, 96881, '<td valign="top">The overexposed areas on the face are a distraction.  Some extra PP might have been able to make the colours of the leaves stand out even more</td>', 'The overexposed areas on the face are a distraction.  Some extra PP might have been able to make the colours of the leaves stand out even more', '2008-11-25 19:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5084061, 740218, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great sky in this photo.  The colours in the sky are great without looking fake like can happen when people PP thier photos too much.</td>', 'Great sky in this photo.  The colours in the sky are great without looking fake like can happen when people PP thier photos too much.', '2008-11-25 19:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5084065, 740261, 96881, '<td valign="top">I am wondering what the motion blurred thing is beside the vertical strut here.  It is a wire or something else blown around and therefore blurred by the long exposure you have used in dark conditions.  Colours in ths photo are great.  Like the gradiant sky while avoiding overexposing the bottom corner</td>', 'I am wondering what the motion blurred thing is beside the vertical strut here.  It is a wire or something else blown around and therefore blurred by the long exposure you have used in dark conditions.  Colours in ths photo are great.  Like the gradiant sky while avoiding overexposing the bottom corner', '2008-11-25 19:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5084130, 739310, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice Colours in the photo.  Iternal reflections though detract from the photo.</td>', 'Nice Colours in the photo.  Iternal reflections though detract from the photo.', '2008-11-25 20:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5084131, 740336, 96881, '<td valign="top">Different.  I like the lighting in this photo, and I like the off centred crop as well.</td>', 'Different.  I like the lighting in this photo, and I like the off centred crop as well.', '2008-11-25 20:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5084135, 739761, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and you achieved the intent well.  Perhaps the brightest area fromt he backdrop being centred around the hands would draw completeattention to it rather than the area beteen the head and the hands</td>', 'Nice idea and you achieved the intent well.  Perhaps the brightest area fromt he backdrop being centred around the hands would draw completeattention to it rather than the area beteen the head and the hands', '2008-11-25 20:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5084137, 740247, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the photo and the reds through the sky.  Lighting of the subject has also been achieved reasonably well<br/>It is a bit of a stretch to really make the challenge topic though.</td>', 'I like the photo and the reds through the sky.  Lighting of the subject has also been achieved reasonably wellIt is a bit of a stretch to really make the challenge topic though.', '2008-11-25 20:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5084140, 740283, 96881, '<td valign="top">The composition of the photo is good.  However the harsh frontal lighting, causing the refelectiosn, especially straight off the large front of the woody is a distraction.  Better defused light would have made this a better shot.</td>', 'The composition of the photo is good.  However the harsh frontal lighting, causing the refelectiosn, especially straight off the large front of the woody is a distraction.  Better defused light would have made this a better shot.', '2008-11-25 20:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5084141, 740024, 96881, '<td valign="top">I never knew Art drove a Pink Car, however he has picked up well there.  Shame Zilla is about to bite his head off.</td>', 'I never knew Art drove a Pink Car, however he has picked up well there.  Shame Zilla is about to bite his head off.', '2008-11-25 20:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5084143, 740299, 96881, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about  your choice of a border here.  I don''t think it is the right colour for the shot.  The photo overall appears to be slightly overexposed, evident on the crayons and some areas of the box.  Depth of field though is good</td>', 'I''m not sure about  your choice of a border here.  I don''t think it is the right colour for the shot.  The photo overall appears to be slightly overexposed, evident on the crayons and some areas of the box.  Depth of field though is good', '2008-11-25 20:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5084146, 739136, 96881, '<td valign="top">Interesting Graffiti.  The bright area to the right is a distraction.  I would have been tempted to use a shallower depth of field and just shot the graffiti (cropped out the bright area) and had the red face the main subject, and the rest fading out of focus.</td>', 'Interesting Graffiti.  The bright area to the right is a distraction.  I would have been tempted to use a shallower depth of field and just shot the graffiti (cropped out the bright area) and had the red face the main subject, and the rest fading out of focus.', '2008-11-25 20:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5084147, 740270, 96881, '<td valign="top">The overall darkness of this photo, and combined with the way Art is inserted into the photo does not work for me</td>', 'The overall darkness of this photo, and combined with the way Art is inserted into the photo does not work for me', '2008-11-25 20:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5084152, 740174, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  However I feel the scene is too cluttered.  I don''t think all those bushes were necessary.  Simplifying this photo would have had a better effect.<br/>Noise in the background is a problem.<br/>This type of shot didn''t need to be taken IN the tank.  Having Art as he is, with the rock to one side, a plant to the other and two fishes would have given us the same impression, without the clutter, and scored better.  Taking it outsside the tank would also make the lighting and PP easier, and the noise would have been easily avoided.</td>', 'I like the idea.  However I feel the scene is too cluttered.  I don''t think all those bushes were necessary.  Simplifying this photo would have had a better effect.Noise in the background is a problem.This type of shot didn''t need to be taken IN the tank.  Having Art as he is, with the rock to one side, a plant to the other and two fishes would have given us the same impression, without the clutter, and scored better.  Taking it outsside the tank would also make the lighting and PP easier, and the noise would have been easily avoided.', '2008-11-25 20:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5084154, 739816, 96881, '<td valign="top">nice Capture of the Woody.  Well cropped.  DOF is good witht he background still readable but not distracting.</td>', 'nice Capture of the Woody.  Well cropped.  DOF is good witht he background still readable but not distracting.', '2008-11-25 20:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5084156, 739870, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice Idea.  Not sure though of the Red background, as it then means the flame does not stand out as much.  Blue may have worked better as the burnt areas would still be noticable</td>', 'Nice Idea.  Not sure though of the Red background, as it then means the flame does not stand out as much.  Blue may have worked better as the burnt areas would still be noticable', '2008-11-25 20:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5084162, 739470, 96881, '<td valign="top">I ma not sure the long shutter speed works here.  It makes the people less visible (including the one in front).  I presume this was on a tripod, but the Church doesn''t look sharp.  Did you press the shutter, use a cable release/remote or use the timer.  For long shutter speeds, pressing the button moves the camera, hence the cable release or use the timer to avoid this.  Just speculating as to why its not sharp, I might be wrong though.......<br/>The colours are not really inspiring.  Making the sky look really stormy in PP could have helped the image</td>', 'I ma not sure the long shutter speed works here.  It makes the people less visible (including the one in front).  I presume this was on a tripod, but the Church doesn''t look sharp.  Did you press the shutter, use a cable release/remote or use the timer.  For long shutter speeds, pressing the button moves the camera, hence the cable release or use the timer to avoid this.  Just speculating as to why its not sharp, I might be wrong though.......The colours are not really inspiring.  Making the sky look really stormy in PP could have helped the image', '2008-11-25 20:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5084168, 739555, 96881, '<td valign="top">There are a number of marks in the black which I believe could have been cloned out.  The angle of the photo is good, but the subject does not really make for a good shot.  The uneven lights in these signs always make it hard to get a great shot.</td>', 'There are a number of marks in the black which I believe could have been cloned out.  The angle of the photo is good, but the subject does not really make for a good shot.  The uneven lights in these signs always make it hard to get a great shot.', '2008-11-25 20:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
