(5084891, 740010, 89940, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yospiff:</b></div><hr/><i> Not a bad score for one you didn''t think was very good! You seem to have gone from "my photography sucks" to "ribbon hog" in a very short time. Congrats on nailing down the "secret". </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I owe all my success to this wonderful site. Back when I wrote the "my photography sucks" thread, it really did suck, but people here were so helpful and gave me some great comments on how to improve. So I just applied myself to the task of getting better and it''s has paid off. But I never would have gotten there without the wonderful feedback and support from the people here on DPC. Thanks to you all.</td>', 'Originally posted by yospiff: Not a bad score for one you didn''t think was very good! You seem to have gone from "my photography sucks" to "ribbon hog" in a very short time. Congrats on nailing down the "secret".   I owe all my success to this wonderful site. Back when I wrote the "my photography sucks" thread, it really did suck, but people here were so helpful and gave me some great comments on how to improve. So I just applied myself to the task of getting better and it''s has paid off. But I never would have gotten there without the wonderful feedback and support from the people here on DPC. Thanks to you all.', '2008-11-26 01:52:49.000000', NULL, 0),
